            [PHP] The 'char INPUT[ANY]' and 'char OUTPUT[ANY]' typemaps in typemaps.i are no longer
            supported and have been removed, for consistency with the other target languages, which
            have no array typemaps in typemaps.i. To keep using them, copy them from typemaps.i in an
            earlier version of SWIG into an interface file.

            *** POTENTIAL INCOMPATIBILITY ***

